Please **always** keep the project specifications in mind!

# Project Technical Specifications

This project uses UniApp to develop H5 pages, which may need to be ported to WeChat Mini Programs in the future. Therefore, try to use Mini Program/H5 compatible writing methods during development.

## Tech Stack

- UniApp 3.0.0
- TypeScript 5.8.3
- Vue 3.4.38
- Wot UI 1.9.1
- UnoCSS 66.2.3
- VueUse 13.4.0
- Pinia 2.0.36

## Project Structure

```
src/
├── api/                  # API-related
├── components/           # Global components
│   └── ui/               # Pure UI components
├── composables/          # Global composables
├── layouts/              # Page layout components
│   ├── default.vue       # Default layout
│   └── p0.vue            # Padding-0 layout
├── pages/                # Business pages. Files in this directory will be automatically registered as routes. Only pages should be placed here, not components or composables.
├── static/               # Static files
├── stores/               # State management
├── styles/               # Style files
│   ├── theme.ts          # Global theme file
│   └── variables.css     # Global style variables
├── utils/                # Utility functions
└── theme.json            # WeChat Mini Program theme configuration
```

